arameter': 'r', 'value': 'Record{id=7, name="empty.net.", type=CNAME}'}], 'expected': False, 'description': 'ANSWER section is an empty list, AUTHORITY section is null, ADDITIONAL section is an empty list. No `contains` check succeeds, so the method returns false.'}]}]
